esire or capability, but of responsibility and timing. Gondor has been ruled by stewards for generations, and the people have grown accustomed to their governance. To suddenly assert my claim would sow discord and instability when Gondor already faces grave threats from Mordor.","text_height":400,"text_offset_x":0,"text_offset_y":0,"text_pitch":1,"text_sound":"minecraft:random.wood_click","text_width":300,"time_availability":0,"title_color":16777215,"title_pos":0,"visual_preset":0}
