ad...\nshe spoke of my father and the fall of Gondor, \nand she said to me: Even now, there is hope left. \rBut I cannot see it...it is long since we had any hope.\r\rMy father is a noble man, but his rule is failing and our..our people lose faith. He looks to me to make things right... and I would do it, I would see the glory of Gondor restored.","text_height":400,"text_offset_x":0,"text_offset_y":0,"text_pitch":1,"text_sound":"minecraft:random.wood_click","text_width":300,"time_availability":0,"title_color":16777215,"title_pos":0,"visual_preset":0}
