f Rivendell! Welcome @p !\n\nThis is the Council of the Fellowship of the Ring!\nWe have gathered here to decide what will happen to the ring!\nHe can't stay here in Rivendell, it would be too dangerous!\nThe ring must be destroyed! And that only works if he is thrown into the lava of Mount Doom! The place where it was made!\n\nI was there.. 3000 years ago... Isildur should have destroyed it...\n\nAnd now the task falls to one of you!","text_height":400,"text_offset_x":0,"text_offset_y":0,"text_pitch":1,"text_sound":"minecraft:random.wood_click","text_width":300,"time_availability":0,"title_color":16777215,"title_pos":0,"visual_preset":0}
