s 111th birthday party. \nBut while he was giving his speech, something strange happened. \nHe just disappeared...\n\nAnd that in front of all the guests. You can imagine how confused everyone was.\nCan you go to the Hobbiton and find out what happened?","text_height":400,"text_offset_x":0,"text_offset_y":0,"text_pitch":1,"text_sound":"minecraft:random.wood_click","text_width":300,"time_availability":0,"title_color":16777215,"title_pos":0,"visual_preset":0}
