"comparison_type":0,"objective_name":"","value":0}],"show_previous_dialog":true,"show_response_options":true,"show_wheel":false,"sound":"","spacing_preset":0,"start_quest":-1,"text":"The Nine! The Black Riders. Or also called Nazgul. Once kings of men, they are now slaves to the will of Sauron.\nThey are connected to the One Ring like their master and feel his power!\n\nI fear after much torture the creature Gollum has revealed the position to the enemy and now they are headed here.\nYou must hurry @p and leave the Shire quickly. It's not safe here anymore.","text_height":400,"text_offset_x":0,"text_offset_y":0,"text_pitch":1,"text_sound":"minecraft:random.wood_click","text_width":300,"time_availability":0,"title_color":16777215,"title_pos":0,"visual_preset":0}
