 quietly towards the window, eyeswide with tension. He raises his staff above the window, and slams it down on the intruder. THERE IS A YELP OF PAIN!)\r\rSAMWISE GAMGEE !!!\rIt's a little late for trimming the hedges, don't you think?\r\r@p, he will come with you, meet him at the Brandywine Bridge. ","text_height":400,"text_offset_x":0,"text_offset_y":0,"text_pitch":1,"text_sound":"minecraft:random.wood_click","text_width":300,"time_availability":0,"title_color":16777215,"title_pos":0,"visual_preset":0}
